WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.150
We won the district tournament 
and reserved our spot in the city tournament.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.490
We are the Momoyama Predators!

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:17.160
The 3U developed their own special move, the Small Three.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.930
Each of them trained their own strong points.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.770
Now we're waiting for the day of the tournament!

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.010
Wow, I can't wait anymore!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.440
Breakfast is ready.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:06.640
Be sure to eat it.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.240
Okay!

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:15.080
Good morning.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:19.720
Tomorrow is finally the first day of the city tournament!

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.790
Misaki-san!

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.300
You guys are finally here!

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.800
Long time no see!

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.630
We're here again!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.140
Hello.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:39.510
You made it to the city tournament? That's great!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.510
Thank you very much!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:44.180
We wanted to thank you!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.210
Me?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:51.480
Yes! If we hadn't met you, the Furuyas wouldn't have returned to the field!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.850
That would've made reviving the Predators quite hard!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:58.690
I wouldn't have wanted to play soccer with Shou-kun!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.860
Eh!? Really?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.360
Of course.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.830
Oh, jeez.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.600
I didn't do anything.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:11.370
The team you guys made yourselves made it past the district tournament.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.540
Do your best!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.870
Okay!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.380
Have you found a coach yet?

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.010
Yes! His name is Hanashima Masaru.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.880
Eh? The one who used to be on the Thunderbolts?

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.020
Yes.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.120
Do you know him, Misaki-san?

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.590
Of course.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:31.190
Oh? Your team is led by <i>the</i> Lightning Light?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.430
My expectations are high.{I expect a lot.}

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.060
Are you part of the team, too?

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:41.300
Y-Yes. I'm Saionji Reika.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.600
Nice to meet you.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.780
N-Nice to meet you, too.

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:55.780
She just started playing soccer in April, 
and is pouring her all playing as a defender.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:56.880
I see.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.850
Misaki-san!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.420
Looks like the mini-game is about to begin.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.320
You guys are playing, right?

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:03.990
Eh?

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.360
C-Can we!?

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.930
What are you saying?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.530
You guys even brought your bags. I know what you're thinking.

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.500
Well...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.770
Well, I guess you're right.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.140
Let me see how much you've improved.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.310
Don't mind! Don't mind!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.320
Erika-chan, move back! No one's marking #7!

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.790
Nice, Erika-chan!

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:41.430
Looks like she doesn't hesistate when tackling anymore.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.800
Good. He's gotten a lot better.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.170
Erika-chan!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.340
Hey!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.740
I guess not.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.180
Everyone! The other side is open! Watch out!

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.140
He's always letting his voice out.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:02.210
That's more like a captain.{That's more like it, Captain.}

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:06.290
Reika-chan! Mark #4!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.270
Don't mind, Reika-chan.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:29.140
I'll support you. Be more aggressive.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:30.980
Okay.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.910
Okay, that's enough!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.150
Switch players!

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.250
How was it?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.490
Girasol is definitely amazing.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.990
I can't get the ball when I'm being marked that tightly.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.500
They're fast and strong.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.200
We kept getting pummeled.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.300
Really?

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:57.370
You guys did pretty well against high schoolers.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.540
Reika-chan, was it?

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.740
Y-Yes!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:04.540
It's fine if you are nervous.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:08.110
But don't overestimate the opponent.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.250
Eh?

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:13.250
No matter how strong your opponent is, he or she is still a normal human being.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.790
Just focus on what you can do, and do it well.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.730
You've been a part of the team for so long.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:20.660
Be more confident.{Bring out your confidence. }

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.690
O-Okay.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.830
I have high expectations for all of you.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.930
But Amarillo is quite a strong team.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.740
Yes!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.010
I'm home!

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:37.610
Excuse us!

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.910
Drink up, you two!

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:44.080
Thanks! I'm so thirsty!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:46.950
Eh? Reika-chan?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:49.520
What's the matter? You seem down.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.320
Eh?

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.890
Are you feeling sick?

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.800
No, it's nothing. I'm fine.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:59.260
You're fine?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:03.800
Is it really okay for me to take part in the city tournament?

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.770
Of course!

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.410
Really?

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.540
Of course!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.710
Yeah!

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:15.610
B-But there will be amazing players at the city tournament.

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:18.550
I couldn't keep up back then.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:22.850
I'll just be holding everyone back.{I'll just be making the team worse.}

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.460
That's not true!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.890
Misaki-san told you already!

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.390
Bring out your confidence!

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:32.000
Yeah! If there are people stronger than you,
 then just think about practicing even harder!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.300
I-I can't do that.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:39.270
I just started playing soccer. 
No matter how much I practice...

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.270
That's not true!

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:45.480
Practice is not useless!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.820
I'm super crappy, but with practice I got better!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.450
Maybe...

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.620
...just a little bit.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:53.650
A little bit!?

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.890
But he's right.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:59.730
No one becomes amazing in a day.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.390
Don't think so much about it and just practice!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.360
Erika-chan...

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.530
Why don't we practice right now?

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.900
There's a ball right here.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.370
Hey! No! Don't touch that!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.710
You're so loud!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.950
W-What's wrong, Erika-chan?

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.080
D-Don't tell me this is...

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:25.050
Tanaka Satoru's autograph!?

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.890
I've never seen the real thing before.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:32.220
Actually I'm a big fan of Tanaka.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.830
Why do you have something like this?

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:38.700
That ball, you know... When I was little...

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:51.380
I drew... an elephant.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.440
Shou-kun!

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:56.010
Try speaking loud and clear when giving a presentation!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:07.460
Hey, let me play, too...

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.170
Wait up!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:19.300
Who is this shy crybaby!?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.310
Eh? That's me!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.080
Stop lying!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.580
It's true!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.350
Anyway, let me continue!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:32.450
I'm home.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.090
Hey, hey!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.350
Your voice is too soft!

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.560
I keep telling you to speak from your gut!

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:40.930
Welcome home, Shou.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.400
Dad...

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:48.330
Welcome!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.870
Here you go! Two orders of short ribs!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.700
Our meat is delicious!

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.110
Eat up!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.880
Hey! No, no, no! That's going too far!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.410
Just grill it a bit and that should be okay.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.610
Try it with this sauce.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.320
Delicious!

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.350
See?

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:09.350
Our meat and sauce are both world number one!

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:18.130
Ken-chan, looks like it'll be tough for Japan to make it out of the group stages in the World Cup.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.470
What are you saying? It's too soon to give up!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.200
We just need to win the next match...

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.900
Goal!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.170
Japan takes the lead!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.570
All right!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.940
Of course we win!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.710
Hurray! Hurray!

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.780
Shou! The weather's nice out.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.550
Wanna go kick the soccer ball around at the park?

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.120
It'll be fun!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.460
No, I'm reading.

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.790
I see...

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.500
Gotta pee...

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:01.070
Yes, go! That's it! Oh no!

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:02.810
Ugh! So close!

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:09.850
Yes! Go! Go! Tanaka!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:14.150
Shou? Sorry about that. Did I wake you up?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.150
Yes.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:19.260
All right! Come sit next to me!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.830
We'll watch together.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:26.670
Tanaka Satoru takes the ball up the wing.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.900
He passes to the middle.

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:30.100
Yes! Nice pass!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.640
What's that player's name?

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:38.280
Oh? He's Tanaka Satoru.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:40.050
He's the commander of the national team!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.550
He's so cool, right?

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.010
Y-Yeah.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.320
Go, go!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.150
That's it, Tanaka!

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:46.550
Go!

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.620
I couldn't take my eyes off the TV.{I couldn't move my eyes away from the TV.}

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.690
Tanake gave it his all even when they were about to lose.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.790
I started cheering him on.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.100
G-Go.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:02.070
Go, Tanaka.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.470
Go, Tanaka!

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:05.740
Go!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:13.610
And that became Tanaka's final match as a professional player.

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.220
Dad.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.720
I want to try kicking the ball.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.890
What?

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.960
I see.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.290
Okay, let's go!

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:31.260
Okay.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.300
Shou, here I go!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.400
Here!

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.140
Huh?

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.110
Don't mind! Don't mind!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.880
Nice kick!

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.750
You'll become an awesome striker!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:53.750
Really?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.920
Yeah, of course!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.330
Ow...

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.860
You aren't very good at soccer?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:07.270
Oh, be quiet! Watching and playing are completely different things!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:15.770
Dad, I want to become like Tanaka.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.840
I see. Just work hard, then.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:19.740
Really?

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.150
Yep!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.220
Then I'll become the best yakiniku restaurant owner in the world!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.590
You become the best soccer player in the world!

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:28.420
Yeah...

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:31.090
You gotta raise that voice though.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:32.090
Okay.

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.590
Promise, okay?

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.030
Okay!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.910
Look!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:53.010
What's that?

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:56.250
It's a flyer about the Momoyama Predators looking for players.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.380
Eh?

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:03.590
Their youth team is looking for new players as young as first graders.

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.660
Team...

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.660
Soccer is played with eleven people.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:11.160
I think it's about time for you to join a team.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.370
Will I be okay?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.000
Don't worry!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.840
You've worked so hard, haven't you?

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:19.100
Have some confidence.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.410
O-Okay.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.420
And the day finally came for me to join the team.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:44.600
You're amazing. What's your name?

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:52.540
Isn't it proper manners to state your own name before asking for other's?

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:55.470
What's with you, Mister? What's your name?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.610
Eh? Triplets?

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.150
You can't even do it once?

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.690
How lame.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:08.750
You fail.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.130
What?

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.800
You gave up and came straight back home? Why?

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.730
Because everyone was so much better than I was!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.740
I can't become a regular player!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.840
I-I see. But you should try at least!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:28.970
I know!

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:34.410
I was the worst one there! Everyone was laughing at me.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.880
Why do I need to join a team?{Why must I join a team?}

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.650
Didn't you say I'd be fine?{Wasn't it all okay? }

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:39.750
Well...

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:43.250
Yeah, it'll be okay!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:47.360
Even if you aren't very good right now, 
you'll catch up with a lot of practice!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.660
It's impossible!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:51.830
When I do catch up, they'll be even better!

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.470
I quit playing soccer.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.500
Hey!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.670
Don't quit!

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.540
Aren't you gonna become the best player in the world?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.640
That's impossible!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:07.650
You can't become the best yakiniku restaurant owner either!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.580
W-What?

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:11.680
I hate soccer!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.280
Hey!

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:24.360
Dad kept trying to get me to practice.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:31.040
But I refused to touch a soccer ball.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.740
Wow.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.710
How nice.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:38.940
What's the matter?

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:40.350
Oh, Shou.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:45.680
The Japanese National Team is playing at the Momoyama Stadium tonight.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.690
Tanaka is coming!?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.160
That's amazing!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:55.460
But there are no more tickets.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:59.030
I should've bought them earlier.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.770
Yeah.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:04.640
Oh? Shou?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:14.610
I wanted to see the real player...

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.880
Shou!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.150
We're going out! Get ready!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.020
I'm not going to practice soccer.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.690
Not that! We're going to see Tanaka!

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:28.390
Eh!?

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.210
What are you doing, Dad?

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.820
I'm barbequing! Can't you see?

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:54.250
Not that! What about our tickets?

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.750
I don't have any!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.060
Don't worry about it.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:03.130
The match will soon be over and 
Tanaka will walk out from over there.

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:06.560
He'll come eat our yakiniku.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.600
He won't be able to stop himself when he
 smells the aroma of the world's best yakiniku.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.240
Believe me!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.010
World number one?

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.640
You just put that there yourself, Dad.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.980
Hey, what are you doing?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:23.580
Oh, good day there. Great job you're doing.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.580
This is not a public space!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.690
You can't put up a stand here!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.250
There now, why don't you have a taste?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.620
I just finished this batch. It's delicious!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.860
What are you saying!? Where's your permit?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.430
Get out of here!

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.430
Hey now, hey now, just have a taste first.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.200
D-Dad!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.070
I won't!

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.200
How about it?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.670
That smells pretty good.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.670
It isn't mediocre!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.610
It smells awesome!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:49.440
Just have a taste!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:53.210
Oh! Tanaka!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.780
P-Please have a taste!

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:55.780
Enough of that!

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.250
H-He's here!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.050
Have some! Freshly made!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.090
That looks delicious.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:24.040
It's Tanaka! The real one!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.050
That was good. No wonder you're world's number one.

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:28.680
Thank you very much!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.480
How much was it?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.880
No need to pay me.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.650
Instead...

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.320
Can you autograph this, please?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.760
He's my son, Shou.

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:47.670
He's an introvert who stays inside all day, but after watching your matches,

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:51.200
he told me for the first time that he wanted to try playing soccer.

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:53.970
When I see him happily chasing the ball,

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:59.340
I become filled with joy.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.820
But he lost his confidence because of a few setbacks.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.450
Now he seems to hate soccer.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.920
I'm a failure of a parent.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:11.090
I don't want to force him to play.

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:20.430
But I don't want him to forget that joy of chasing after the soccer ball!

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:24.440
I'm sure he'll remember if he gets an autograph from his favorite player.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:25.870
Please! I beg of you!

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.440
Dad...

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.550
You actually do love soccer, right?

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.320
Yes.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:49.530
Even if you aren't very good, just practice many times more than everyone else.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:52.560
One day you will find your own position which you're good at.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:06.540
Everything you do now is connected to the future.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.280
Yes!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.160
Dad.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:19.690
Hmm?

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:25.260
I want to try joining the Momoyama Predators again.

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:28.570
I see. Do your best.

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.740
Wow... I really got to meet him.

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:35.040
Your yakiniku <i>is</i> number one in the world!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.970
Yeah, that's right!

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.550
So that happened.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:46.780
Yep.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:51.160
I'm sure your father...

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.620
Yep. It happened two years ago.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:57.060
That's why this ball is the best memory I have of him.

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:59.730
Everything I do now is connected to the future.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.470
That's why practice is never useless.

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:04.040
Right, Reika-chan?

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:09.440
Yes!

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:19.050
Nice clear!

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:21.520
You really are loud!

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:24.390
That shy crybaby was a lie!

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.560
I hope my voice can reach you.

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:35.830
I'm doing my best, Dad!

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:53.350
Heavens...

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.920
Amarillo...

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:00.220
Okay, let's go!

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:02.360
Yeah!

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:36.650
Finally, the city tournament!

00:24:36.650 --> 00:24:38.260
Everyone is so pumped up!

00:24:38.260 --> 00:24:39.790
I won't lose, either!

00:24:39.790 --> 00:24:42.260
We're the Predators, that's why!

00:24:42.260 --> 00:24:44.700
Aren't Predators meat eaters?

00:24:44.700 --> 00:24:45.230
Yep!

00:24:45.230 --> 00:24:47.630
Nom, nom, nom!

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:49.270
We're gonna nom up the competition!

00:24:49.270 --> 00:24:50.400
That's a lot of spirit!

00:24:50.400 --> 00:24:52.500
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!!

00:24:52.500 --> 00:24:54.270
First Goal!
